      "cooked": "<p>Hello Everyone,</p>\n<p>I’ve been trying to find a way for when some new Student is created, I’d like him or her to come with some custom Role and Permissions, is it possible to do?</p>\n<p>Like, now when a Student is created, it comes like this:<br>\nOBS: only with Student checked</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/b/fb3b891c40313d61872522287aa45ea58132d634.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/fb3b891c40313d61872522287aa45ea58132d634\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/b/fb3b891c40313d61872522287aa45ea58132d634_2_690x362.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zQvoLDIxwNsvqCu4NLqRAwvmSna\" width=\"690\" height=\"362\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/b/fb3b891c40313d61872522287aa45ea58132d634_2_690x362.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/b/fb3b891c40313d61872522287aa45ea58132d634_2_1035x543.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/b/fb3b891c40313d61872522287aa45ea58132d634_2_1380x724.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1F1F1F\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1472×773 80 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>But I would like it to come like this:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/0/20492b9baa1c9c68298d2ee12a50f7720c67e03e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/20492b9baa1c9c68298d2ee12a50f7720c67e03e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/0/20492b9baa1c9c68298d2ee12a50f7720c67e03e_2_617x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"4BC2Q1QyPh2qWXdd3sOo1wXcCxo\" width=\"617\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/0/20492b9baa1c9c68298d2ee12a50f7720c67e03e_2_617x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/0/20492b9baa1c9c68298d2ee12a50f7720c67e03e_2_925x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/0/20492b9baa1c9c68298d2ee12a50f7720c67e03e.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1E1D1D\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1096×888 72.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Notice, that when a user has only “Student” checked as Roles, it can’t access the Modules, so I need to check Academic user as well, so user has access to Modules, as you see in the second picture.</p>\n<p>Could anyone help me with that please?</p>",
